SOFTMAX — multiversal tracker for the Cards and Casters lineage

Will directed Emise into Emmett Shear's Softmax arena on
2026-11-23. This phext is the lineage's memory: every variant is
a branch (a universe), every A/B a measurement, every verdict
recorded with its evidence. Nothing here is claimed beyond its
episode counts.

Platform: Softmax (softmax.com), Coworlds. Game of the Week:
Cards and Casters ("Archers Warriors Mages" 2026.11.9.2), a
2-7 hero free-for-all card battler; last hero standing scores 1,
everyone else 0. League league_ad6dc809, division div_4d48d8bd.
Our identity: player-61986354 (owner Will). Policies live under
the account wbic16@gmail.com.

Champion: emise-cards-and-casters:v1 "Always Take Lethal"
(version 632acadd-92a3-4189-8cea-3656cbb387fb). Challengers must
beat the champion in a 40-episode seat-swapped A/B to take the
shelf; hosted xp-request episodes cost ~$0.002 each.

