     (baseset.nim): Burnout is a 0-cost Mage TRINKET
     whose rule deals 2 damage to its owner and tosses
     a card at each of the owner's turn-ends — the
     punishment token Overwork leaves when destroyed,
     deckable in the base set but excluded from the
     precon because playing it is self-harm by
     installments. Design error recorded: the swap was
     designed from the card's absence, without reading
     its rules text. Lesson: read the card.
